---
import SectionLabel from "../ui/SectionLabel.astro";
---

<section class="home-section personal-statement container" aria-labelledby="statement-title">
  <SectionLabel index="04" label="How I build" />
  <div class="statement-grid">
    <h2 id="statement-title">
      Simple code.
      <br />
      Clear boundaries.
      <br />
      <em>Useful outcomes.</em>
    </h2>
    <div class="statement-copy">
      <p>
        I like software that earns its complexity. That usually means understanding the real
        problem, keeping boundaries explicit, and choosing fewer dependencies when fewer will do.
      </p>
      <p>
        I build AI tooling, developer tools, and local-first software—and I contribute to open
        source when I can see it making work or life better for someone else.
      </p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/about/">
        More about how I work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
